Just maybe it is time to ask these high end AIs we have how the economy must be restructured and how do we get there from here with minimum pain.

Paying people no to work is a non-starter. We do that already. It's called welfare. Look at the mess it has created. An idle well fed human without something to do as a reason to live and be emotionally rewarded for it is the single most deadly dangerous type of object on the planet.

{o.o}
